  "mu_name_from": "MuMain _enum.h MONSTER_MUTANT (62), drawn as MONSTER_MODEL_MUTANT = 45 (_enum.h:4195), so OpenMonsterModel loads Monster46.bmd. OpenMU Version095d Maps/Tarkan.cs names breed 62 'Mutant'. docs/tarkan-port.md.",
