  "sheet_from": "Data/Monster's sander.OZJ (the body), sander.OZT (the rags, its alpha a mask) and sander2.OZJ (the mask and blade), under a mutant_ prefix; the .OZJ and .OZT share a stem, so the rags are mutant_sander_tga.png.",
